{
  "//": "Plugin parameter manifest, read by PluginProcessor at construction. These become host-automatable AudioParameterFloat objects. op{k}_wave is a stepped 0..5 -> sine/triangle/sawtooth/square/sample/wavetable (todo.md §114 added index 4; wavetable-morph position is separately snapped into 0..3, so switching to 4 is a discrete jump like lfo{n}_wave's own 4=sample-hold; index 5 is a REAL multi-frame wavetable oscillator, Task 4 multi-agent work order — distinct from the legacy 0..3 wavetable-morph position). op{k}_roothz is only meaningful in sample mode — the fundamental the loaded file was recorded at, so playback pitches correctly. op{k}_wtid picks a built-in table (0/1, dsp/wavetables.js — more may be appended) and op{k}_wtpos (0..1) scans continuously across its frames; both only meaningful in wavetable mode, and op{k}_wtpos is also a mod-matrix target (op{k}WtPos). The loaded sample ITSELF (path/version/duration/waveform peaks) isn't a manifest param — see PluginProcessor's op{k}_samplepath/_sampleversion/_sampleduration/_samplepeaks, seeded straight into `state` in the constructor. Port phase P2 (todo.md §68.6): 4 operators, each with wave/level/pan/pitch.",
  "//P5": "24-slot mod matrix (todo.md §108 — raised from 8, which was silently dropping routes past the 8th, including on preset reload). mod{n}_src indexes MOD_SRC_IDS in ui/translate.ts, 0..40: 8 built-in sources ['env1','env2','env3','lfo1','lfo2','lfo3','velocity','keytrack'] then 8 Macros (todo.md §111, macro0..macro7 params below, APPENDED to the source table — never reorder, this index is live host automation). 16..40 = the optional + modulator pool (up to 10 added modulators in ANY mix; ids grow to env11, lfo10, audiofollower10) (audiofollower/env4/env5/lfo4/lfo5/lfo6, then env6-8, lfo7-8, audiofollower2-4) (ENV 2/3 and LFO 1-3 are optional too, via mod_on_env2/env3/lfo1/lfo2/lfo3; a source that is routed is always built) (their mod_on_* flag says whether the module is added). mod{n}_dst indexes MOD_DST_IDS in the same file (82 entries, 0..81; 76..81 = native arp/seq targets seqRate..seqRandom via ctlout; was 56 entries, 0..55: 'off', global pitch, per-op level/pitch/pan/modAmount/wave/filterMix, the 4 filter cutoff/reso targets, lfo1/2 rate, then the 24 per-source PM/FM depth targets added in §95). mod{n}_amt is bipolar. Keep NUM_MOD_SLOTS here in sync with ui/translate.ts and plugin/dsp.main.js.",
  "//P6": "Master FX chain (todo.md §113) — 8 reorderable slots. fxslot{n}_type: 0=off, 1=delay, 2=reverb, 3=distortion, 4=chorus, 5=flanger, 6=compressor, 7=phaser, 8=eq (APPEND new effect ids here as they're built — never reorder, this index is live host automation).",
